flowchart LR
  subgraph Sources[Synthetic data sources]
    EHR[EHR simulator]
    WEAR[Wearable simulator: sleep, HRV, RHR, steps, adherence]
    CUFF[Home BP cuff: ground truth]
  end
  SIM[Scenario runner / live sensor simulator] --> ING
  EHR --> ING
  WEAR --> SIM
  CUFF --> SIM
  ING[Ingestion API + SQLite UTC] --> FUS[Fusion + feature engineering]
  FUS --> ML[LightGBM + isotonic calibration]
  ML --> TWIN[Digital twin service]
  TWIN --> SHAP[SHAP explanations]
  TWIN --> WIF[What-If service]
  TWIN --> FP[Sleep fingerprint]
  TWIN --> ALR[Alert service]
  TWIN --> WS[WebSocket + REST, JWT RBAC]
  SHAP --> WS
  WIF --> WS
  FP --> WS
  ALR --> WS
  WS --> DASH[React clinician dashboard]
